{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:10.35.050","page_type":"section"},"citation":"10.35.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","content_hash":"406efcc02bdfab7e20b563065ae2ffb5a61fcc287b032150f5ed33f1de26fe55","heading":"Electric-assisted scooters – Parking requirements.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","text":"(a) Operators shall park electric-assisted scooters on hard surfaces in either the frontage zone or amenity zone of the sidewalk; beside bicycle racks, transit stops or bike share stations; or in another area specifically designated for scooter parking, which will not in any way inhibit the pedestrian zone.\n(b) It shall be unlawful for the operator of an electric-assisted scooter to engage in any of the following activities:\n(1) Park in any street or in any area where parking is prohibited.\n(2) Park on a sidewalk in such a manner that inhibits the pedestrian zone.\n(3) Park on private property without the written consent of the owner.\n(4) Park in a manner that would impede access to bike racks, including Topeka Metro Transit Authority bike share stations.\n(5) Park in, or in a manner that would impede access to, or the use of any of the following:\n(i) Buildings, parking lots, or garages;\n(ii) Motor vehicle driving lanes or bicycle lanes;\n(iii) Loading zones, disabled parking zones or designated parking spaces on the street;\n(iv) Curb ramps;\n(v) Entrances to private property or driveways;\n(vi) Transit zones, including bus stops and shelters; and\n(vii) Utility infrastructure, including traffic control devices and utility poles.\n(c) The Municipal Judge shall establish a schedule of fines to be imposed for violations of this section. The fines shall not exceed the amount established for traffic infractions related to parking. (Ord. 20178 § 4, 4-9-19.)\nCross References: Municipal Judge, TMC 2.20.060 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"139ce7be-de5f-527d-8f6e-716dd6d418a8"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","content_hash":"bc10f947365646ca09999b8d3bf023333474d8a7eec8b45789cea677d0da989e","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","text":"(a) Operators shall park electric-assisted scooters on hard surfaces in either the frontage zone or amenity zone of the sidewalk; beside bicycle racks, transit stops or bike share stations; or in another area specifically designated for scooter parking, which will not in any way inhibit the pedestrian zone.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"fc0fff86-fae4-512e-815f-01fb06c69576"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","content_hash":"4de20c9eaa4536fd5dd03e35a23e0b1d917b0eaa139a06aed3e7902b5db85414","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","text":"(b) It shall be unlawful for the operator of an electric-assisted scooter to engage in any of the following activities:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"061b493b-0465-5519-951a-c60a7712613f"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","content_hash":"2ede0d41f0761f500d2944bcf4ca2670cbc2b3ebf40edcb3afed11a2b3cdcd4e","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","text":"(1) Park in any street or in any area where parking is prohibited.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"05f00c69-7732-5e2e-9ff3-9f13a2921108"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","content_hash":"b9f23df37000da92d48bc8fbd10bffb9b6b1803827434c489b2d4004dfffa3d7","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","text":"(2) Park on a sidewalk in such a manner that inhibits the pedestrian zone.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"16ce06e3-7b92-5701-a453-c4a8089fc8bf"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","content_hash":"eef1a342390a719b4b4e79e5d4f05e9966409f002c2ffb1ae3334e296fffdb3e","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","text":"(3) Park on private property without the written consent of the owner.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"bf246b05-5b82-53ce-9cb8-f01abaeefece"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","content_hash":"125b97f213ee090e89e341e64d8bfae2c53b425d95c4faa59b18e9d4e29e36ed","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","text":"(4) Park in a manner that would impede access to bike racks, including Topeka Metro Transit Authority bike share stations.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"5274f523-e0ea-5a50-a2f1-37231f0e0c7a"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","content_hash":"d6db49dd17587d13f1bcbc5d7c6b7fa3a1f19e259ad27a00bd9a3a25863b14f0","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:6","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","text":"(5) Park in, or in a manner that would impede access to, or the use of any of the following:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"c7b0f21e-ec81-56e2-a02f-41d1d3fa9bbb"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","content_hash":"7d99434668afbf5e84554666ee5e26f7f6b488e4e9f8da8a7816979d462c1bf7","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:10.35.050:block:7","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/10.35.050","text":"(i) Buildings, parking lots, or garages;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e2d40e3a-faf7-55e0-adeb-90d20c3285c9"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"10.35.050","citation_url":"https: